gxde-bernese (1.0.3-gxde5) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Fix a crash in SetBlurBehind() on Wayland with Qt < 6.9.
    QWindow::winId() does not return the wl_surface there (Qt 6.8 gives 1),
    so the id was handed to wl_proxy_get_class() and the process died on
    the first blur request.  Ask the platform plugin for the surface with
    QPlatformNativeInterface and only fall back to the window id when it
    looks like a pointer.

 -- shenmo <shenmo@spark-app.store>  Sat, 31 Oct 2026 22:40:00 +0800

